{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a mysterious island full of secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up after hundreds of years in <strong>Chaos Rider,\u00a0</strong>an epic <strong>MetroidVania</strong> style game! As a powerful robotic adventurer, you\u2019ll unravel the secrets of an ancient civilization buried in a sprawling, non-linear world. Every corner hides mysteries, dangers, and treasures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/ef88283267eb56456ab16fb796e9fb3f.poster.avif?t=1758838552\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/ef88283267eb56456ab16fb796e9fb3f.webm?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/ef88283267eb56456ab16fb796e9fb3f.mp4?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overcome challenges and discover tools to improve exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a gauntlet of deadly obstacles as you uncover tools to conquer the unknown! From glowing caverns to crumbling spires, wield upgrades like a grappling hook, a bouncing ball, or a gravity gun and many others to navigate deeper into uncharted territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/31011fd1fd4cabf2a8d37821d69e4a3f.poster.avif?t=1758838552\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/31011fd1fd4cabf2a8d37821d69e4a3f.webm?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/31011fd1fd4cabf2a8d37821d69e4a3f.mp4?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Devastating Force in Action-Packed Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate hordes of dangerous creatures and towering bosses in fast-paced battles! Slash, stomp, shoot and punch with a combat system boasting 6\u00a0 elemental damage types and a vast arsenal of weapons. Dodge through danger with holographic finesse and crush enemies. Every fight is a test of skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/0e4374cae0add7fdc33e0b172780af80.poster.avif?t=1758838552\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/0e4374cae0add7fdc33e0b172780af80.webm?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/0e4374cae0add7fdc33e0b172780af80.mp4?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experiment With Technology To Create Your Own Playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize your robotic body with mods, weapon-mods, and armors to create a playstyle that\u2019s uniquely yours. Experiment with powerful combinations to unleash chaos, and hatch creatures via the life printer to fight by your side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/fcd80c18b3843e5ed8ef564677bf48c5.poster.avif?t=1758838552\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/fcd80c18b3843e5ed8ef564677bf48c5.webm?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/fcd80c18b3843e5ed8ef564677bf48c5.mp4?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/992f79d91475e4dde03fc1a483458f7b.poster.avif?t=1758838552\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/992f79d91475e4dde03fc1a483458f7b.webm?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/992f79d91475e4dde03fc1a483458f7b.mp4?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A\u00a0 massive non-linear world full of mysteries to explore and discover. Find your own path and fulfill the dream of the Great Architect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super cool and fluid player movement mechanics. Use your upgrades and your tools to navigate through the challenges and obstacles at full speed and reach new heights... or new depths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize yourself to create your own playstyle with tech modules, weapons, armors and weapon-mods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge through foes and hazards with the holographic dodge and stomp enemies head.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced combat system with 6 different types of damage , a large variety of weapons and tons of mods and weapon-mods to customize yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An affinity and perk system with levels and many discovery to make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter strange characters and creatures.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of a mysterious and the Great Architect</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603410?t=1758838552","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/e7c73b1d45fddb88c71bd814172ff768c81874e6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758838552","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/0a6b0af84dcbb267edad2e41708e945bb29c5cab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758838552","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/0a6b0af84dcbb267edad2e41708e945bb29c5cab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758838552","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a mysterious island full of secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up after hundreds of years in <strong>Chaos Rider,\u00a0</strong>an epic <strong>MetroidVania</strong> style game! As a powerful robotic adventurer, you\u2019ll unravel the secrets of an ancient civilization buried in a sprawling, non-linear world. Every corner hides mysteries, dangers, and treasures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/ef88283267eb56456ab16fb796e9fb3f.poster.avif?t=1758838552\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/ef88283267eb56456ab16fb796e9fb3f.webm?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/ef88283267eb56456ab16fb796e9fb3f.mp4?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overcome challenges and discover tools to improve exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a gauntlet of deadly obstacles as you uncover tools to conquer the unknown! From glowing caverns to crumbling spires, wield upgrades like a grappling hook, a bouncing ball, or a gravity gun and many others to navigate deeper into uncharted territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/31011fd1fd4cabf2a8d37821d69e4a3f.poster.avif?t=1758838552\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/31011fd1fd4cabf2a8d37821d69e4a3f.webm?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/31011fd1fd4cabf2a8d37821d69e4a3f.mp4?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Devastating Force in Action-Packed Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate hordes of dangerous creatures and towering bosses in fast-paced battles! Slash, stomp, shoot and punch with a combat system boasting 6\u00a0 elemental damage types and a vast arsenal of weapons. Dodge through danger with holographic finesse and crush enemies. Every fight is a test of skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/0e4374cae0add7fdc33e0b172780af80.poster.avif?t=1758838552\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/0e4374cae0add7fdc33e0b172780af80.webm?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/0e4374cae0add7fdc33e0b172780af80.mp4?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experiment With Technology To Create Your Own Playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize your robotic body with mods, weapon-mods, and armors to create a playstyle that\u2019s uniquely yours. Experiment with powerful combinations to unleash chaos, and hatch creatures via the life printer to fight by your side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/fcd80c18b3843e5ed8ef564677bf48c5.poster.avif?t=1758838552\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/fcd80c18b3843e5ed8ef564677bf48c5.webm?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/fcd80c18b3843e5ed8ef564677bf48c5.mp4?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/992f79d91475e4dde03fc1a483458f7b.poster.avif?t=1758838552\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/992f79d91475e4dde03fc1a483458f7b.webm?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/extras/992f79d91475e4dde03fc1a483458f7b.mp4?t=1758838552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A\u00a0 massive non-linear world full of mysteries to explore and discover. Find your own path and fulfill the dream of the Great Architect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super cool and fluid player movement mechanics. Use your upgrades and your tools to navigate through the challenges and obstacles at full speed and reach new heights... or new depths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize yourself to create your own playstyle with tech modules, weapons, armors and weapon-mods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge through foes and hazards with the holographic dodge and stomp enemies head.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced combat system with 6 different types of damage , a large variety of weapons and tons of mods and weapon-mods to customize yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An affinity and perk system with levels and many discovery to make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter strange characters and creatures.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of a mysterious and the Great Architect</p></li></ul>","developers":["Galaxy Factory Inc"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603410/33773a61ff05d2b34b5a06109a9e91f084fc0dfe/header.jpg?t=1758838552","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stron